-- Bundled groups: a group as one structure of its carrier, operation, unit,
-- and inverse, the laws of a group under their standard names, and the
-- group rewrite set
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
-- Copyright (c) 2026 Grant Passmore.
